---
name: mate-commands
description: What a `mate` command's refusal means and what to do about each, the output of `project facts` and `recall`, and setting up console editor bindings, plugins and the captain's task tracker. Load it when a command refuses, before a command you have not used, and when the captain asks about the console, plugins or a tracker. Syntax is in `mate <command> --help`.
